<title>UK: Wuerttembergische Hypo sets 100 mark bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttembergische Hypo sets 100 mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY  **28.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    09.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1	   LISTING    STUT	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	**STEPS UP TO 4.55 PCT FROM 28.APR.97 IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 826</p>
